## 🏛️ The Golden Safety Rule Enforced

> **The AI Assistant must NEVER directly execute a financial mutation from an LLM tool call.**
> Every mutation requested by the user or identified by the AI is drafted as an `assistant_action_proposal` with `pending_confirmation` status.
> Only an **authenticated human confirmation request** passing **PBAC verification**, **TTL validation**, **SHA-256 payload integrity check**, and **idempotency deduplication** inside an **ACID database transaction** may execute the mutation.

